# React & TypeScript Guidelines

- Use functional components with strict TypeScript types. Avoid `any`.
- Adhere to the project design tokens defined in CSS and UI kits.
- Ensure full accessibility: include semantic HTML, ARIA landmarks, and keyboard focus states.
- Run `npm test` and `npm run lint` before committing changes.

